  "rules_en": "ASCII letters A–E; a literal ASCII space is a permanent boundary. Only runs of at least two identical consecutive letters within a segment are removable. Name one letter to remove its entire leftmost eligible run across the tape. Empty segments never erase a boundary. After deletion, neighboring letters in the same segment can merge. Ignore spaces only when matching the target. Stop immediately when the target is reached. If the round's priority letter has an eligible run, you must choose it. Otherwise choose any removable letter.",
